  "business_overview": "Elauwit Connection, Inc. provides broadband internet networks in the United States. It offers network design, engineering, and installation, as well as project management and quality control of fiber optics and Wi-Fi networks; and provides dedicated bandwidth, 24/7 network monitoring, network maintenance, and resident support services. The company is also involved in managed services and network-as-a-service solutions. It serves REITs, property ownership groups, and property management companies. The company was founded in 2019 and is headquartered in Cheyenne, Wyoming.",
